					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 3
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Rusting Antennae (13): The rust monster has specialized antennae that are not armored, but provide a normal sense of touch. The antennaes allow the creature to feel things one yard away and can be targeted at -6 (comparable to eye-stalks described on p. B34). In addition, the rust monster can touch a metal object with its antenna to deal it 5d corrosion damage. It can parry with its antennaes."
				}
